Read `AGENTS.md` first and follow it as the source of truth for this project.

Before making changes:
- Read `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.
- Check `docs/CHANGELOG.md` for recent work.
- Keep edits scoped to the requested files.

After making changes:
- Update `docs/CHANGELOG.md`.
- Run `npm run build` when code or markup changes.
- Keep `src/data/match_messages.json` and `public/src/data/match_messages.json` in sync when editing report messages.
